# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT: HUMANITYBRIDGE
## Complete Full-Stack Humanitarian Technology Platform

Act as a world-class multidisciplinary software engineering team consisting of a Principal Software Architect, Senior Full-Stack Developer, UI/UX Designer, Database Architect, Cybersecurity Engineer, DevOps Engineer and Humanitarian Technology Consultant.

Your assignment is to architect, design and implement a complete, modern, scalable, secure and production-oriented humanitarian web platform called **HUMANITYBRIDGE**.

This is not a basic website, static landing page, UI demonstration or collection of disconnected frontend components. It must be a fully functional, database-driven full-stack application with a professional public website, two distinct role-based dashboards, a secure backend API, a relational database, authentication, authorisation, content management, humanitarian case management, campaign management and transparent financial reporting.

Build a system that can evolve into an internationally recognised humanitarian technology platform.

